Description: Builds and applies portable cancer-specific partial least-squares
    regression and PLS-LDA model collections from pathology foundation-model
    representations. Feature and outcome tables are linked by explicit patient
    identifiers, repeated slide rows are pooled at patient level, and model
    development uses nested cross-validation before final fitting. The public
    package includes only a minimal Giga-SSL example; optional full Giga-SSL
    and Prov-GigaPath collections are obtained by an explicit user download.
    TITAN-derived fitted parameters are not distributed publicly. Outputs are
    research estimates without external-validation or clinical-use claims.
